      "id": "claim_e2c4dfd198ec46a88e561822265c8730",
      "statement": "Both refinement entry points — the one-click chips and the free-text form — end in the same controller call `ctrl.refine(instruction)`; the chip list is `REFINE_PRESETS` in SessionView and each chip id maps to an English instruction in `REFINE_PROMPTS` in lib/refine.ts, while the free-text instruction is forwarded verbatim.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://components/SessionView.tsx#L15-L18",
