      "id": "claim_27488064fe854f39a8f54f15500a97f9",
      "statement": "The refinement patch is merged into the existing program by the app-side wrapper `applyPatch`, which delegates to the OpenUI runtime's `mergeStatements` and special-cases the two empty cases: with no previous program the patch is the program, with an empty patch the program is kept.",
