      "id": "claim_3631045dc967439285b5ba7099c6586a",
      "statement": "Standing styles and refine chips are different mechanisms: the standing styles (`actionItems`, `timeline`, `simpler`) are appended to the summary prompt as rules via `settings.styles.map((s) => STYLE_RULES[s])` so they apply to every new summary, whereas a chip is a one-off instruction sent for the currently open summary; `shorter` and `moreDetail` exist only as chips.",
